 "remarks": "Fully Furnished Byram Home | $3,600/Month All-Inclusive  Welcome to this charming fully furnished home in Byram, Greenwich, offering vintage character, comfortable living spaces, a private yard, and an exceptionally convenient location. At $3,600 per month, the rent includes electric, water, gas, heat, hot water, garbage pickup, snow removal, and lawn/leaf maintenance, providing a simple and predictable rental experience with no hidden fees.  The home features inviting fully furnished living and dining rooms with vintage character, along with a spacious, well-equipped kitchen. The upper level offers three bedrooms, with two bedrooms available for tenant use and the third bedroom reserved for storage for the owner's daughter. A convenient washer and dryer are located in the basement.  Outside, enjoy a welcoming front porch, private yard and patio, private driveway, and additional street parking. The garage is available for storage, providing additional space for tenants. Window AC units up to 5,000 BTUs are permitted in individual bedrooms.  $3,600 Monthly Rent Includes: Electric Water Gas, including heat & hot water Garbage pickup Snow removal Grass, trimming & leaf maintenance  Tenants are responsible for setting up and paying for their own Wi-Fi.",
